            <div class="grid_4">
              <a href="https://www.dgcrane.com/overhead-crane-electromagnetic-lifting-magnets/"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Round-lifting-electromagnetMW5-SERIES.png?w=276&amp;h=184" alt="Round lifting electromagnetMW5 SERIES" width="276" height="184" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Round-lifting-electromagnetMW5-SERIES.png?w=276&amp;h=184 1x, /wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Round-lifting-electromagnetMW5-SERIES.png?w=552&amp;h=368 2x" />
              <h4>Crane Electromagnetic Lifting Magnets: for Safe and Efficient Steel Handling</h4>
              <p>The crane electromagnetic lifting magnets are an efficient lifting tool widely used for handling various ferromagnetic materials, such as steel plates, cast iron ingots, steel balls, pig iron blocks, and machining chips.</p>
